    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented, fully furnished two-bedroom house available to rent in the popular Forest Park development. The property is situated behind an electric gated entrance and offers bright, comfortable and spacious accommodation throughout.\n\nThe house features two generously sized double bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an ensuite bathroom and the second bedroom having access to a Jack & Jill bathroom.\n\nThe bright and welcoming living room has sliding patio doors leading out to a small patio area and the communal garden. The living room also benefits from a cosy stove, providing a lovely additional feature to the home.\n\nForest Park is ideally located within walking distance of Courtown Beach and is less than a 10-minute drive from the beach and local amenities. This is an ideal opportunity for anyone looking for a comfortable, fully furnished home in a peaceful coastal location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
